        {
          "content": "Compound sentences cannot be formed by joining two independent clauses with only a comma. In \"The dog barked, he ran away,\" both clauses are complete thoughts, making a lone comma structurally insufficient to connect them. To fix this, use one of three proper punctuation tools.",
